# Browser automation profiles — NEVER commit these.
# They contain live Google session cookies and "Login Data" (2,531 such
# files at last count). data/chrome-profile/ above covered the original
# profile; these patterns cover the per-market ones the drone/fire
# pipelines create. The tracked data/*.json files are unaffected.
data/*_chromium/
data/*_chrome_profile/
data/*_extensions/
data/*_profile_*/
data/ai_mode_chrome_profile*/
data/status_profile_*/
data/*.owner
